* XSS
* DOM XSS
* unsafe HTML rendering
* unsafe URLs
* malicious user-generated content
* injection through query parameters
* compromised third-party scripts
* clickjacking
* token leakage
* insecure browser storage
* malicious redirects
* unsafe iframe embedding

Avoid dangerous DOM sinks unless there is a justified, sanitized use case.

Prefer safe rendering patterns.

