# 61. SEO PAGE MODEL

### Public Website

→ generally indexable

### Public Content

→ indexable when intended for search

### Blog / Articles

→ indexable when useful

### Products

→ indexable when appropriate

### Documentation

→ indexable when appropriate

### Dashboard

→ private / generally non-indexable

### Admin

→ private / generally non-indexable

### Authentication

→ private / generally non-indexable

### Account / Settings

→ private / generally non-indexable

### Checkout / Internal Utility

→ generally non-indexable unless explicitly required

### Development / Staging

→ non-indexable

Never accidentally place the whole public website behind a global `noindex`.

