# 62. SEO PAGE-LEVEL SYSTEM

Every public/indexable route must define, where applicable:

* unique `<title>`
* meta description
* canonical URL
* robots directives
* Open Graph metadata
* social metadata
* structured data
* semantic heading hierarchy
* descriptive URL
* internal links
* page-specific imagery

