Do not:

* add arbitrary margins to hide layout errors
* add arbitrary absolute positioning
* use overflow clipping to conceal overflow
* duplicate styles to override previous styles
* add magic numbers without design-system justification
* use `!important` as the default solution
* hardcode per-device exceptions unnecessarily

